{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "He's here all the way from Kansai.": "",
  "Who is this guy?": "",
  "Number two?": "",
  "Name's Satoshi Shioya. The guy's a natural born fighter,\nand soon enough, he'll be chairman.": "",
  "Satoshi Shioya, clan captain of the Kyorei.\nThe guy's a bruiser, and one day he'll be chairman.": "",
  "And he's the one who ordered the shooting?": "",
  "So, he's the one who\nordered the shooting?": "",
  "No doubt. Though he was targeting Hamura,\nnot Kurimoto.": "",
  "No doubt. Though I'm thinking Shioya's\nreal target... was Captain Hamura.": "",
  "What makes you say that?": "",
  "Hm? What makes you say that?": "",
  "Take a look at this. It's a shot of Kurimoto\nright after the shooting.": "",
  "Take a look at this.\nThis is Kurimoto right after the shooting.": "",
  "Tough to look at.": "",
  "Ugh. Gruesome.": "",
  "Man got bullets through both eyes. But that's not\nwhat I wanna show you. Look at his clothes.": "",
  "Man got a bullet through both eyes.\nBut that's not the point. Look at his clothes.": "",
  "His clothes?\nWhat about them?": "",
  "The captain was wearing\nthe same jacket yesterday.": "",
  "Yesterday, the captain was wearing\na jacket just like his.": "",
  "They're about the same age,\nand they look the same from behind, too.": "",
  "They're about the same age,\nsame kinda build...": "",
  "Safe to say the captain knows\nwho they were really after.": "",
  "The cap's already figured it out.\nHe was the real target.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So the Kyorei attack was meant\nfor Hamura specifically, not the Tojo Clan?)</color>": "",
  "Explains why he went into\nhiding so quick.": "",
  "I get it... Explains why he went\ninto hiding so quick.": "",
  "Heh. Funny how this all worked out.": "",
  "Funny how things work out, huh?": "",
  "You don't look very worried.": "",
  "What, you think this shit\ndoesn't affect you?": "",
  "If the Kyorei are gunning for Captain Hamura, why wouldn't\nthey go for the guys who set him free, too?": "",
  "If the captain's on the Kyorei shitlist, why wouldn't they\ngo for the guys who set him free? Think about it.": "",
  "What, you think they're coming for me?": "",
  "You think they'll come for me next?": "",
  "Nah. If anything,\nShintani's the one who should worry.": "",
  "After all, he was Hamura's lawyer.": "",
  "After all, he was the actual defense\nin that case.": "",
  "He won't stand a chance\nwith yakuza gunning for him.": "",
  "A civvie won't stand a chance if\nthe yakuza are gunning for him.": "",
  "If I were you,\nI'd at least give him a heads up.": "",
  "If you can get ahold of Shintani,\nyou should probably give him a heads-up.": "",
  "How's my favorite know-it-all doin'?\nGood?": "",
  "How's my favorite little know-it-all?\nYou been doin' good?": "",
  "Who is this?": "",
  "Kasai.\nY'know, from the Keihin Gang.": "",
  "Kasai, from the Keihin Gang.\nI've been thinking about what you did.": "",
  "And you're calling me... why?": "",
  "And you're calling me because...?": "",
  "Yagami-san, do not listen to him!": "",
  "Yagami-san, don't listen to him!": "",
  "Kim-san? Everything okay?": "",
  "Shut yer mouth!": "",
  "If you wanna see your friend alive again,\nget your ass over here!": "",
  "You wanna see your friend alive again,\nget your ass over here. <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Now</font_kind>!": "",
  "That bastard...": "",
  "(Shintani's gonna have to wait.\nI need to go save Kim-san!)": "",
  "We're done with the 20 questions, yeah?\nI gotta head over to the office soon.": "",
  "We done here? Whole family's meeting at the office.\nI don't wanna be late.": "",
  "Kim-san!": "",
  "Yagami-san... I'm so sorry.": "",
  "Yagami-san... I'm sorry.": "",
  "Heh. I forgot how much you\npiss me off, know-it-all.": "",
  "I forgot how much you\npiss me off, know-it-all.": "",
  "And I forgot how dumb you look,\nso we might as well call it even.": "",
  "What was that!?": "",
  "So this is our guy, huh?": "",
  "So this is Yagami-san, huh?": "",
  "I've heard a lot about you, Yagami-san.\nRumor has it you're a skilled little skullbuster.": "",
  "Yagami-san! I've heard a lot about you.\nRumor has it you're a skilled little skullbuster.": "",
  "Uh, thanks?": "",
  "Well, thank you.": "",
  "The name's Honda. Renji Honda,\nfrom the Keihin Gang. Pleased to meet ya.": "",
  "The name's Honda. Renji Honda, from the\nKeihin Gang. Pleased to meet ya.": "",
  "Honda! Shut up and help us\nkick his ass already!": "",
  "Honda! Shut up so we can\nkick his ass already!": "",
  "Help you?": "",
  "C'mon, boys!": "",
  "Dude, Honda... What the fuck?": "",
  "H-Honda... Why...?": "",
  "What the hell're you doing!?": "",
  "H-Hey, what the hell're you doing!?": "",
  "I was lookin' forward to this fight.\nNot gonna waste it by just dogpilin' the guy.": "",
  "I was lookin' forward to this fight.\nIt'd be a waste to dogpile the guy.": "",
  "...Be glad to give you a taste\ntoo if you disagree.": "",
  "...If you don't like it,\nI can give you a taste too.": "",
  "Hey, what's your deal?": "",
  "Hey. What's your deal, man?": "",
  "Just wanna fight you, that's all.": "",
  "That's the whole reason I joined the Keihin.\nLockin' fists with tough bastards like you.": "",
  "Whole reason I joined up was to\nlock fists with tough guys like you.": "",
  "So c'mon, let's tango.": "",
  "Sorry, but I really don't\nhave time for this.": "",
  "Fighting's the only thing that keeps the world\nspinning, Yagami-san. I know you agree.": "",
  "Come on, Yagami-san. You and I know fighting's\nthe only thing that keeps the world spinnin'. Right?": "",
  "Now enough talk.\nI'm ready for some fun!": "",
  "Now, that's enough talking.\nI'm ready for some fun!": "",
  "Hahahaha, you're even beefier than\nI'd heard! This is freakin' great!": "",
  "Haha! You're even beefier than I'd heard!\nThis is freakin' great!": "",
  "I'm not too big on fighting\nfor no reason, though.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Looked like you were havin' fun to me.\nYou're a natural-born fistflinger!": "",
  "Oh yeah? Looked like you were havin' fun to me.\nYou're a natural-born warrior!": "",
  "I think we're done here.": "",
  "Random bystander phoned the coppers on us.\nThey'll be here any second.": "",
  "Random bystander snitched on us.\nCops'll be here any second.": "",
  "...Go.": "",
  "What about your fight? I thought that's\nwhat keeps the world spinning.": "",
  "I thought fighting was the only thing\nkeeping the world spinning.": "",
  "Heh. Can't exactly fight you\nif you're rotting away behind bars.": "",
  "Heh. Can't exactly fight you\nif you're rotting away behind bars!": "",
  "Let's go, Yagami-san! Hurry!": "",
  "Yagami-san! We need to go, now!": "",
  "Uh, okay.": "",
  "Uh, sure...": "",
  "Hey, that was a real hoot!\nLet's do it again sometime, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Phew. We should be safe now.": "",
  "I think we should be all right now...": "",
  "Who was that guy, Kim-san?": "",
  "...Kim-san, what was all that?\nWho was he?": "",
  "You do not know?": "",
  "You mean you don't know?": "",
  "That was Honda.\nOne of the Keihin Four.": "",
  "That was Honda.\nI heard he's one of the Keihin Four.": "",
  "The... what?": "",
  "Keihin Four?\nShould I know them?": "",
  "It's what they call the four\nhighest ranking members of the Keihin Gang.": "",
  "Yes! It's what they call the four highest\nranking members of the Keihin Gang.": "",
  "Kasai, Honda, Sakakiba, and Koga.": "",
  "There's Kasai and Honda.\nThen Sakakiba and Koga.": "",
  "Each of the Four has their own faction,\nand countless thugs doing their dirty work for them.": "",
  "Each of the Four has their own faction,\nand countless underlings to command.": "",
  "So there are two more...": "",
  "So there's two more of those\nwhackjobs besides those guys?": "",
  "Yes, and I hear Koga's faction\nis the strongest of them all.": "",
  "And there's more... I hear Koga's faction\nis the strongest of them all.": "",
  "Word on the street is that they line their pockets\nselling weapons on the black market.": "",
  "People say they make millions, all from\nselling weapons on the black market.": "",
  "Not even the yakuza are keeping up\nwith how powerful they've become.": "",
  "With that power, not even the yakuza\ncan match their might.": "",
  "Well then let's hope this \nKoga guy stays far away from us.": "",
  "Koga, huh?\nLet's just hope he keeps his distance.": "",
  "So sorry...": "",
  "I am afraid it's my fault\nthat they are coming after you.": "",
  "If it wasn't for me... Yagami-san, you would\nnever have gotten wrapped up in this!": "",
  "It's all good.": "",
  "Nah, it's fine.": "",
  "Please, just be careful, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yagami-san... Please be careful.": "",
  "You too, Kim-san.": "",
  "I will. You too, Kim-san.": "",
  "(Glad that's over.\nNow for Shintani.)": "",
  "You have a sec, Shintani-sensei?": "",
  "Shintani-sensei, you have a sec?": "",
  "There's something I need to\ntalk to you about.": "",
  "Hmph, perfect timing.\nI've got a few words for you myself.": "",
  "Perfect timing. I've got a few\nwords for you myself.": "",
  "If you're gonna fight, take it outside.\nDon't make Hoshino-kun clean up a mess.": "",
  "Take it outside if you're going to fight.\nI'd feel bad if Hoshino-kun had to clean up your mess.": "",
  "I wonder what Shintani-sensei has to say...": "",
  "What's going on?\nShintani-sensei sounds serious...": "",
  "You boys play nice, okay?  Business hasn't\nbeen booming like this for years.": "",
  "Hey, you boys play nice, okay?\nBusiness hasn't been booming like this for years.": "",
  "Sounds like Hamura's not too happy.\nWith you.": "",
  "Sounds like Hamura's not too happy.\nSpecifically with you.": "",
  "He says to quit digging around.\nWe won the case. It's done.": "",
  "He says to quit digging around\nin a case that's already solved.": "",
  "And I've gotta say,\nI agree with him.": "",
  "Or was my victory\nnot good enough for you?": "",
  "Oh, your victory\nand yours alone, huh?": "",
  "Your victory, huh?": "",
  "You heard me. I was the lawyer.\nMy victory.": "",
  "You heard me.\nI was the lawyer who won that case.": "",
  "And thanks to that,\nwork's been just flooding in.": "",
  "It's over, Yagami.\nLet it die.": "",
  "It's over, so just let it die.": "",
  "Your work might be over,\nbut the murderer is still out there.": "",
  "Your work might be over in the courtroom,\nbut the murderer is still out there.": "",
  "This \"Mole\" you're dying to catch?": "",
  "Hmph. And <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you're</font_kind> gonna catch this \"Mole\"?": "",
  "Well fuck right off! Your little detective\ngame has done enough damage!": "",
  "Time to back the fuck off!\nYou playing detective helps nobody!": "",
  "Why don't you just leave this alone!?\nHuh!?": "",
  "Why won't you just leave this alone?\nHuh!?": "",
  "Hamura knows who the murderer is.\nHe hid it from us the whole trial.": "",
  "This whole time, Hamura's known the real murderer.\nHe hid it from us the whole trial.": "",
  "And that \"innocent\" verdict\nmade fools of us all.": "",
  "He made fools of us\nwith that verdict.": "",
  "Maybe you're okay with that,\nbut I'm not about to give this up.": "",
  "Maybe that doesn't bother you...\nbut I'm not about to give this up.": "",
  "Hah! You talk big, but you're just a mouse,\nand Hamura's a hungry fucking cat.": "",
  "Hah! You can certainly talk a big game,\nbut all you're doing is running from him.": "",
  "Funny, he's the one in hiding.": "",
  "Last I heard,\nHamura's the one in hiding.": "",
  "The Kyorei are gunning for him.\nThat's what the shooting was about.": "",
  "You know, Shintani-sensei has been talking\nto Hamura-san quite often lately.": "",
  "About what exactly?": "",
  "Well... Mostly about how\nthey both hate your guts.": "",
  "Well... Mostly about how they\ncan't stand you.": "",
  "Huh. Cool.": "",
  "Oh. Cool.": "",
  "Can you and Shintani at least try to get along,\nespecially in my office?": "",
  "You and Shintani are always at each other's throats.\nCan't you two try to get along?": "",
  "Or do I need to drag you both\noutside and box your ears in?": "",
  "Keep a lid on it next time,\nor I might just knock you one myself.": "",
  "You think Shintani-sensei knows something\nabout the Mole that he's keeping from us?": "",
  "About Shintani-sensei... You think he\nknows something about the Mole?": "",
  "Nah, probably not.\nHe'd never shut up about it if he did.": "",
  "I'm sure if he did,\nhe'd share it with us.": "",
  "Yo, it's me.\nI'm out front of the Matsugane office.": "",
  "It's Kaito. I'm standing out front\nof the Matsugane office.": "",
  "Looking into the shooting?": "",
  "Looking into last night's shooting?": "",
  "Yup. Place is absolutely swarming with cops.\nKuroiwa's runnin' the investigation.": "",
  "Yup. The place is like a big, blue swarm.\nKuroiwa's runnin' the investigation.": "",
  "Kuroiwa, Kuroiwa...\nYou mean Ayabe's boss?": "",
  "Kuroiwa...?\nOh yeah, you mean Ayabe's boss?": "",
  "That's him.\nSpeaking of, Ayabe's here too.": "",
  "That's him.\nAyabe's actually here too.": "",
  "Makes a convincing cop when he tries.": "",
  "I was actually thinking\nI'd invite him over to Tender.": "",
  "Speaking of, I was thinking some\nmore police info might help us.": "",
  "Try and get my hands on that\njuicy police info, y'know?": "",
  "I figured I'd invite him to Tender.": "",
  "You mind coming along?": "",
  "Not at all.\nSee you over there.": "",
  "Got it. See you at Tender.": "",
  "You must be making a killing with the state this\ncity's in. Ain't that right, Ayabe?": "",
  "With things this bad, you must be\nmaking a killing... Officer Ayabe.": "",
  "And it's all thanks to you.": "",
  "Do you know anything about\nthe Matsugane shooting last night?": "",
  "So that Matsugane shooting last night...\nYou know anything?": "",
  "Not too much, no.": "",
  "But hey, I thought you got Higashi\nfor all your Matsugane needs now.": "",
  "But hey, I thought you had Higashi\nfor all your Matsugane needs now.": "",
  "...Word travels fast.\nWho told you that?": "",
  "Kaito, just now.": "",
  "That'd be... Kaito, just now.": "",
  "Huh? You forget how to keep a secret Kaito-san?\nOr are you trying to get your buddy killed?": "",
  "Huh? What were you thinking, Kaito-san?\nYou really want that getting out?": "",
  "Higashi's screwed if Hamura\nfinds out he's been helping us.": "",
  "If Hamura finds out he's helping us,\nhe's good as dead.": "",
  "Look, man. There's no point\nkeepin' stuff from Ayabe.": "",
  "Look, it's Ayabe.\nThere's no point keepin' stuff from him.": "",
  "Better to just tell him up front\nthan have him find out somewhere else.": "",
  "Better to tell him up front\nthan let him dig it up.": "",
  "What can I say? I'm a professional.": "",
  "What can I say?\nI'm a pro.": "",
  "Sure, professional snitch.": "",
  "A pro...?\nA professional snitch, maybe.": "",
  "If the shoe fits.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Who is this guy?": "คนนี้ใครวะ?",
  "What makes you say that?": "ทำไมถึงพูดงั้นล่ะ?",
  "Who is this?": "นี่ใคร",
  "Shut yer mouth!": "หุบปากซะ!",
  "That bastard...": "ไอ้เวรนั่น...",
  "What was that!?": "ว่าไงนะ!?",
  "Uh, thanks?": "เอ่อ ขอบคุณนะ?",
  "Uh, okay.": "เออ โอเค",
  "Uh, sure...": "เอ่อ ได้สิ...",
  "It's all good.": "ไม่เป็นไรหรอก"
 }
}
